      "id": 8304,
      "name": "Demoralizing Presence",
      "username": "Demoralizing_Presence",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/258eb7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-07-05T19:45:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What an awesome card!</p><p>I know you have been speculating about it (Chaosmancer linked to Omnitron new bio); but I still wanted to analyze carefully this beatiful, mysterious card. So if you allow me, I will highlight the writings on his wall (writings in red! Like the Joker in Batman: Arkham Asylum) and then we can play a little bit with its significance...</p><p>This is what appears clearly in the wall:</p><p><strong>Top, from left to right</strong>: NO WAY OUT-- IT SENDS ITS SERVANT-- THE GUARDS KNOW</p><p><strong>Left, top to botton</strong>: ALL WILL END AS ONE -- NO WAY OUT -- THE FUTURE IS GONE -- NO WAY OUT -- a strange symbol of 4 lines crossing with each other-- NO WAY OUT -- a bunch of marks, a circle, some lines forming a king of triangle.</p><p><strong>Right, top to botton</strong>: CONCENTRIC WORLDS -- marks of the days passing -- and the figure of the Time crazed prisoner, in the bed, hiding in the shadows and looking at us.</p><p><strong>Center of the card, top-right</strong>: THE CHILD IS THE CENTER -- and a a concentric line linked to the sentence before by a second line, as its origin; this concentric line does not close but&nbsp; gets bigger and bigger, with more lines crossing it at different points&nbsp; -- and at the end, the eyes/infinity symbol, with the sentence CAN'T FEEL MY EYES.</p><p><strong>Center of the card, top left and botton of the card: </strong>the window, pointed at by an arrow (night, stars, and a pink light crossing the galaxy) an below the arrow, THIS WAY -- more NO WAY OUT -- a hand of blood in the wall -- a drawing with a planet in the center and more concentric lines , with more planets that have been crossed out, all but the one in the center; on the left of this, EARTH WILL FALL -- below the planet and the concentric lines, we can see two things: another arrow pointing at Earth, and a figure (cut in half) of a human in a circle fro which more arrows emerge;&nbsp; and in the left, a line stright from Earth to the NO NO NO NO NO NO NO.</p><p>Also, the text of the card says this: \"NO WAY OUT.. THE LINES POINT TO IT! IT'S ALL THE SAME! IT ALL COUNTS! NONE OF IT COUNTS! IT WILL BE HERE SOON!\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ideas?</p><p>I have some questions:</p><p>Who is the child and why is she&nbsp; (assuming its a reference to the dreamer) the center? Teh center of what?</p><p>Who is this time crazed prisoner?</p><p>Who is the servant, and who is its master?</p><p>Have you seen \"the lines\" in other cards?</p><p>Are the eyes important?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
