rom Earth to the NO NO NO NO NO NO NO.</p><p>Also, the text of the card says this: &quot;NO WAY OUT.. THE LINES POINT TO IT! IT&#39;S ALL THE SAME! IT ALL COUNTS! NONE OF IT COUNTS! IT WILL BE HERE SOON!&quot;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ideas?</p><p>I have some questions:</p><p>Who is the child and why is she&nbsp; (assuming its a reference to the dreamer) the center? Teh center of what?</p><p>Who is this time crazed prisoner?</p><p>Who is the servant, and who is its master?</p><p>Have you seen &quot;the lines&quot; in other cards?</p><p>Are the eyes important?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
