      "cooked": "<p>Yes, I read the post, but I still thing there are more details to be discuss. For example: \"the guards know\"? WTF!!! Sounds like pure paranoia, on the one hand, but on the other... what if FILTER truly knows and controls what is going on? In my mind, there are two more expansions after Vengeance: one about the Cosmic Encounter narrated in this post, and the other, possibly, is a FILTER/Technology expansion.</p>",
