      "created_at": "2013-07-06T19:13:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've brought this up before, but I'll say it again. F.I.L.L.T.E.R. may not be an evil organization, just the SoTM version of S.H.I.E.L.D. from Marvel comics.Yes they have to do unsavory things and yes they sometimes turn on the heroes, but everything that they do is done for what they believe is for the greater good.</p><p>Yes, they may know about some massive threat that is out there in the cosmos and are keeping quiet about it, but that may be for the fact that they don't want to have the info spread to the wrong people or create mass panic.</p>",
