      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-07-07T06:05:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So you do not think it was FILTER who locks Unity up on her incap side? I always assumed it was</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>In a society that relies so heavily on technology, someone who can shape it to their will with just a thought is EXTREAMLY dangerous if they mis-use their power. And if that person was an uncontrolable and hyper teenage girl(most teenagers are emotional timebombs) in their eyes, then all the more dangerous.</p>\n<p>\"For the greater good\" doesn't always mean fair.</p>",
